  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "намного",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " in front amplifies it to 'much better', while ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "Уж",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "fedya",
   "t": "точно",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " provides a cocky sense of 'that's for sure'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "Тогда давай устроим кулинарный спор!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Then let's make a culinary bet!' The imperative ",
