   "v": "max",
   "t": "давай",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " originates from the verb for 'to give', and placing it before another verb creates a 'let's' proposal. While ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "max",
   "t": "спор",
